; unit-cpuparticles2d.tscn with `use_fixed_seed` and `seed` removed and nothing else changed:
; that absence is the one variable. Every other emitter fixture pins the seed, so the
; previewer's substituted seed, which opens an unpinned scene the same way every time, is
; exercised nowhere else.

